{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28052","headline":"寄妾赵氏 · 房千里","name":"寄妾赵氏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸾凤分飞海树秋，忍听钟鼓越王楼。\n只应霜月明君意，缓抚瑶琴送我愁。\n山远莫教双泪尽，雁来空寄八行幽。\n相如若返临邛市，画舸朱轩万里游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"房千里","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28052.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28052","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}